    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "DEV:  in-process MigrateDatabaseAsync<T>() at startup applies pending migrations.\nPROD:  separate pre-deploy step (multiple replicas would race if it ran in-process). The IMMUTABLE-ONCE-APPLIED rule is the load-bearing invariant.\nSource: each service's Infrastructure/Data/{Service}DbContextFactory.cs · NextAurora.ServiceDefaults/Extensions.cs (MigrateDatabaseAsync) · each service's Program.cs",
      "originalText": "DEV:  in-process MigrateDatabaseAsync<T>() at startup applies pending migrations.\nPROD:  separate pre-deploy step (multiple replicas would race if it ran in-process). The IMMUTABLE-ONCE-APPLIED rule is the load-bearing invariant.\nSource: each service's Infrastructure/Data/{Service}DbContextFactory.cs · NextAurora.ServiceDefaults/Extensions.cs (MigrateDatabaseAsync) · each service's Program.cs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
