      "text": "2.  dotnet ef migrations add AddPromotionCodes \\\n      --project CatalogService/CatalogService.Infrastructure \\\n      --startup-project CatalogService/CatalogService.Api\n\n    (VSA services — Order/Payment/Shipping — collapse to one project:\n      --project OrderService  --startup-project OrderService)",
