    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "d4_t",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "4.  EF diffs current model against ModelSnapshot.cs (the last-committed model state) and emits:\n     • {timestamp}_AddPromotionCodes.cs       — Up()/Down() with provider-specific SQL fragments\n     • {timestamp}_AddPromotionCodes.Designer.cs — frozen model snapshot at this migration\n     • CatalogDbContextModelSnapshot.cs        — updated live snapshot for the next diff\n     All three are added to git so the model history is reproducible.",
      "originalText": "4.  EF diffs current model against ModelSnapshot.cs (the last-committed model state) and emits:\n     • {timestamp}_AddPromotionCodes.cs       — Up()/Down() with provider-specific SQL fragments\n     • {timestamp}_AddPromotionCodes.Designer.cs — frozen model snapshot at this migration\n     • CatalogDbContextModelSnapshot.cs        — updated live snapshot for the next diff\n     All three are added to git so the model history is reproducible.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
